                                                                                           \
 \cf5 13. 
\f2\b \cf4 Shortlist ranking
\f1\b0                                                                      \
     \cf5 - \cf4 The relative weights of confidence, exposure, chemical plausibility, functional     \
       risk, interface risk, and coverage are not defined.                                 \
     \cf5 - \cf4 Without a ranking rule, multiple equally plausible shortlists may result.           \
                                                                                           \
 \cf5 14. 
\f2\b \cf4 Evidence threshold for recommendations
\f1\b0                                                 \
     \cf5 - \cf4 It is unclear whether a residue can be recommended based only on computational      \
       evidence or must have supporting experimental or database evidence.                 \
                                                                                           \
 \cf5 15. 
\f2\b \cf4 Category coverage
\f1\b0                                                                      \
     \cf5 - \cf4 The analysis needs a definition of what counts as adequate coverage for the three   \
       aggregation-focused and two cellular-phenotype-focused exploratory mutations.       \
                                                                                           \
 These do not necessarily prevent starting the analysis, but they should be recorded as    \
 assumptions or resolved before presenting a final shortlist.                              \
