 Structural analysis can 
\f2\b suggest a hypothesis
\f1\b0  that a residue may influence cellular        \
 toxicity when:                                                                            \
                                                                                           \
 \cf5 - \cf4 The residue is confidently modelled.                                                    \
 \cf5 - \cf4 Its exposure and location are established.                                              \
