 I would therefore label such residues 
\f2\b cellular-phenotype candidates
\f1\b0 , not \'93toxicity        \
 residues.\'94 The analysis can suggest a mechanistic hypothesis, while toxicity remains an   \
 experimentally testable endpoint.                                                         \
